#showas:至上的獾
You are facing Zenith-themed foes in a Squares map with Hidden Galaxy enabled.

First, there is a powerful but small Ragnarok AI, alongside a weaker but more numerous Gladiator AI.

Then there is a major Dark Zenith invasion; they've recruited some defensively focused allies to make their empire more formidable.

The Zenith Trader's commitment to bringing peace is doomed for this universe.